;; kanjō 勘定 — seed of PUBLIC-company DISCLOSED 決算 facts (primary disclosure only)
;; ADR-2606032000 · vocabulary: corporate-financials-ontology.kotoba.edn (00-contracts/schemas/)
;;
;; SCOPE: a bounded illustrative slice of real public companies' DISCLOSED financial facts, parsed
;;   conceptually from primary filings — JP EDINET 有価証券報告書 (Toyota / Sony / Nintendo) and US
;;   SEC EDGAR 10-K (Apple / Microsoft). Demonstrates: (1) cross-GAAP normalization (IFRS · US-GAAP ·
;;   JGAAP all land on the SAME canonical :fin.fact/concept), (2) the JGAAP-only :ordinary-income
;;   (経常利益) concept with no US/IFRS twin, (3) as-of history (Toyota FY2023 + FY2024 → YoY).
;;
;; SOURCING (G5): every filing + fact is :representative — these are publicly-documented HEADLINE
;;   figures (annual-results summaries), ROUNDED, NOT the line-item-exact authoritative XBRL. The
;;   real authoritative path parses the EDINET docID / EDGAR accession XBRL (G7 operator-gated,
;;   ingest.py). :company/id reuses the kabuto / tsumugi org.corp.* space. Absence of a company =
;;   "not yet ingested", NOT "no disclosure exists". Monetary :fin.fact/value is in :millions of the
;;   filing currency (e.g. value 45095000.0 :jpy :millions = ¥45.095tn).
;;
;; NON-ADJUDICATING (G2) / NO ADVICE (G4): these are the numbers the company itself disclosed.
;;   kanjō records them; it does NOT rate, rank "good/bad", value, or recommend any action.

